---
description: Phone Controller rules (Flutter phone, .NET host, UDP snapshots)
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` first.

- Phone is Flutter. Host is .NET 9 on Windows. Virtual pad is VIIPER by default, ViGEm only as a fallback behind one interface.
- Wire format is `docs/PROTOCOL.md`. Snapshots, not events. No JSON on the wire.
- Interface haptics are local. Gyro is touch-gated. Silence releases inputs.
- Do not vendor kernel drivers. Do not claim real trigger resistance.
- Run `dotnet test` before finishing. Run Flutter tests too once `apps/phone` exists.
